RAISE SKELETON — NECROMANCER (PRIVATE PLAYTEST)
Syntax: raise skeleton   (alias: raiseskeleton)
Cost: 8 mana. One active skeleton per Necromancer.

Defeat an eligible monster yourself in your current room, then raise its
skeleton. It inherits that monster's maximum HP and MP, starting full.
There is no duration timer. The skeleton follows you and aids your attacks.
It cannot independently finish a monster or generate loot or experience.
Use Vigor, Mend, Restore, compatible wands/scrolls, or a healing potion:
  drink <healing-potion> on skeleton
A skeleton can survive reconnects in the same running server. Durable
restart/room unload persistence is still in development. Pet death ends
its existence. Physical corpses and sacrifice are not enabled yet.
See also: help necromancer | help corpse
